MAQTAL KI SAR-ZAMEEN KI PUR-DARD YE SADA HAI<br>
KARBOBALA KA DULHA PAMAL HOGAYA HAI<br>
<br>
Maqtal Me Shah Pounche Jab Pithe Huwe Sar<br>
Dil Tukde Hogaya Jab Dekha Wo Khooni Manzar<br>
Qasim Bani Ka Lasha Bikhra Huwa Pada Hai<br>
<br>
Ibne Hassan Ke Tukde Qaime Me Shah Laye<br>
Har Bibi Ne Pukara Allaha Haye Haye<br>
Qaimo Me Shah-e-Deen Ke ek Harsh Sa Bapa Hai<br>
<br>
Har-Su Hai Shor-e-Matam Iss Gham Ka Ye Asar Hai<br>
Behosh Hai Sakina Kulsum Nouhagar Hai<br>
Zainab Pe Jo Bhi Guzri Allaha Janta Hai<br>
<br>
Qamush Lab Hai Lekin Har Sans Ro-Rahi Hai<br>
Shadi Abhi Huwi Thi Bewa Abhi Huwi Hai<br>
Taza Dulhan Pe Ya Rab Kya Waqt Aagaya Hai<br>
<br>
Dulhan Ko Kya Sambhale Dulha Ki Maa Hai Muztar<br>
Aankon Me Hai Andhera Shukre Khuda laboun Par<br>
Inka Pisar Chacha Par Qurban Jo Huwa Hai<br>
<br>
Dekhi Hai Karbala Ne Ahsan Ajib Shadi<br>
Dulha Dulhan Hai Pyase Pyase hai Sab barati<br>
Pyase Musafirou Par Gurbat ki inteha Hai